  "metadata": {
    "title": "Instruction tuning teaches models to follow tasks",
    "description": "Instruction tuning fine-tunes a pretrained base model on instruction, optional input, and target output examples. It updates weights using cross-entropy on target output tokens; prompting alone makes no parameter update."
  }
